The mayor and board of aldermen may adopt rules and regulations consistent with this Charter concerning:
(1) The method of employee selection and probationary periods of employment;
(2) The administration of a position classification and compensation plan, methods of promotion and application of service ratings thereto, and transfer of employees within the classification plan;
(3) Hours of work, vacation, sick leave and other leaves of absence, overtime pay, and the order and manner in which layoffs shall be accomplished;
(4) Such dismissal hearings as due process may require; and
(5) Such other personnel policies as may be necessary to provide for adequate and systematic handling of personnel affairs.

